{"id":"n69527-2-2","stage":2,"title":"웬 · 有个","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n69527-2-2-1","ko":"내가 들어오다가 보니까 웬 차가 주차장에 세워져 있더라.","zh":"我进来的时候，看到有个车停在停车场里。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들어오다가","meaning":"进，进来","explanation":"들어오다：进，进来；다가：表示原有动作或状态中途转为另一情况。","readings":[{"term":"들어오다","audio":"/audio/bcc2ebb7204dcac8a7a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74105","senseId":"1","lemma":"들어오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보니까","meaning":"看","explanation":"보다：看；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"웬","meaning":"有个","explanation":"웬：有个","readings":[{"term":"웬","audio":"/audio/0eb778191ab3a0e588b9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69527","senseId":"2","lemma":"웬","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"차가","meaning":"车，车辆","explanation":"차：车，车辆；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"차","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62525","senseId":"1","lemma":"차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주차장에","meaning":"停车场","explanation":"주차장：停车场；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"주차장","audio":"/audio/ae63f424005e52be69b9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91772","senseId":"1","lemma":"주차장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"세워져","meaning":"竖，立；表示成为前面表达的那样。","explanation":"세우다：竖，立；지다：表示成为前面表达的那样。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"세우다","audio":"/audio/23575e84cdfb112c017e.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58163","senseId":"11","lemma":"세우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"2","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있더라.","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；더라：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"bcc2ebb7204dcac8","term":"들어오다","zh":"进，进来","audio":"/audio/bcc2ebb7204dcac8a7a6.mp3","entryId":"74105","definition":"从某个范围外往里移动。","pronunciation":["드러오다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛识辨对象的存在或外观。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"0eb778191ab3a0e5","term":"웬","zh":"有个","audio":"/audio/0eb778191ab3a0e588b9.mp3","entryId":"69527","definition":"某个。","pronunciation":["웬ː"]},{"id":"6ccd3f82b0317e51","term":"차","zh":"车，车辆","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3","entryId":"62525","definition":"搬运人或行李的带轮子的机械。","pronunciation":["차"]},{"id":"ae63f424005e52be","term":"주차장","zh":"停车场","audio":"/audio/ae63f424005e52be69b9.mp3","entryId":"91772","definition":"供停放车辆使用的场地。","pronunciation":["주ː차장"]},{"id":"23575e84cdfb112c","term":"세우다","zh":"竖，立","audio":"/audio/23575e84cdfb112c017e.mp3","entryId":"58163","definition":"固定在地上，使其垂直站立。","pronunciation":["세우다"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的那样。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的那样。","pronunciation":["지다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/84ae16a026533b8f2e55.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n69527-2-2-2","ko":"집에 손님이 오셨나 보다.","zh":"看来家里有客人来了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词